						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Friday, September 10, 2004</p></TD></TR>
						<tr><td><BR><p class="pTitle">MS Windows Service Pack 2 </p>
							<tr><td><p class=pText>
							<p><b><font face="Comic Sans MS" size="4" color="#808000">Microsoft Service Pack 2 IS OUT! (UPDATED INFORMATION AT BOTTOM)</font></b><BR><p><font face="Comic Sans MS" size="4" color="#808000">I am sure most of you know this by now.</font><BR><p><font face="Comic Sans MS" size="4" color="#808000">Now, for those you that didn't or are on a system that gets all uppity about massive downloads and reduces your download capacity like my satellite company does :(  BOOOOO!</font><BR><p><font face="Comic Sans MS" size="4" color="#808000">Windows Service Pack 2 can be ordered FREE of CHARGE.  Microsoft states the CD will take 4-6 weeks to be filled and shipped.</font><BR><p><font face="Comic Sans MS" size="4" color="#808000">I HIGHLY RECOMMEND that you ORDER this CD whether you have downloaded the package or not.</font><BR><p><font face="Comic Sans MS" size="4" color="#808000">I ordered the CD a week ago today and it arrived today!</font><BR><p><b><font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#FF0000" size="3">Adra, Your Friendly Recreational Informational Director :P&nbsp;</font></b><BR><p><b><font face="Comic Sans MS" color="#FF0000" size="4"><BR>LINKS:</font></b><BR><p><a href="http://www.microsoft.com/windowsxp/sp2/sp2_whattoknow.mspx" target="_blank"><font face="Comic Sans MS" size="4" color="#FF00FF"><b>What to Know Before You Download and Install Windows XP Service Pack 2</b></font></a><BR><p><a href="http://www.microsoft.com/windowsxp/downloads/updates/sp2/cdorder/en_us/default.mspx" target="_blank"><font face="Comic Sans MS" size="4" color="#FF00FF"><b>Order SP2 CD</b></font></a><BR><p><a href="http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?kbid=842242" target="_blank"><font face="Comic Sans MS" size="4" color="#FF00FF"><b>Some programs seem to stop working after you install Windows XP Service Pack 2 - Article - 842242</b></font></a><BR>
							<br><BR>
							 - Adrastea<BR><BR>
							</p>
							<a class="abody" href="comments.asp?add=y&Index=563">[Add Comment]</a>&nbsp;
							<BR><BR></TD></TR>
					
						<tr><td bgcolor=FFCC00><p class="pDate">Monday, September 06, 2004</p></TD></TR>
